  "id": "pie-chart",
  "term": "pie chart",
  "definition": "A pie chart is a circular graph used to show how often different categories occur relative to the whole. Each category is shown as a wedge, with larger wedges representing higher relative frequencies; it is most useful when there are only a few categories.",
